{"book":"proverbs","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T21:43:05.711645377Z","verse":10,"ref":"proverbs 27:10","tier":"bulk","chapter":27,"translation":"Your friend and ⟨the⟩ friend of your father, do not forsake ⟨him⟩, and ⟨the⟩ house of your brother do not enter in ⟨the⟩ day of your calamity; better ⟨is⟩ ⟨a⟩ neighbor ⟨who is⟩ near than a brother ⟨who is⟩ far off.","tokens":[{"surface":"רעך","gloss":"Your friend"},{"surface":"ורעה","gloss":"and ⟨the⟩ friend"},{"surface":"אביך","gloss":"of your father"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"תעזב","gloss":"forsake ⟨him⟩"},{"surface":"ובית","gloss":"and ⟨the⟩ house"},{"surface":"אחיך","gloss":"of your brother"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"תבוא","gloss":"enter"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in ⟨the⟩ day"},{"surface":"אידך","gloss":"of your calamity"},{"surface":"טוב","gloss":"better"},{"surface":"שכן","gloss":"⟨a⟩ neighbor"},{"surface":"קרוב","gloss":"⟨who is⟩ near"},{"surface":"מאח","gloss":"than"},{"surface":"רחוק","gloss":"⟨a⟩ brother ⟨who is⟩ far off"}]}